'''Universal Pictures Home Entertainment''' (formerly '''Universal Studios Home Entertainment''') is the home video distribution division of {{wp|Universal Pictures}}, a subsidiary of {{wp|NBCUniversal}} which is a subsidiary of {{wp|Comcast}}.

It has released various ''Pokémon'' movies on DVD in Northern Europe and Scandivanian territories such as the United Kingdom, Germany, Norway and Sweden. ''[[M11|Giratina and the Sky Warrior]]'' was released by them in North America as well. In France, they also released DVDs of ''[[S11|Pokémon: DP Battle Dimension]]'' and ''[[S12|Pokémon: DP Galactic Battles]]''.
